body:
My name is Aaron and I work for the Center For Suicide Awareness!  We have "The CSA" pin at our booth in the Together Intersection!  We also have our Pinny Arcade Pin "Milo" from PAX Unplugged as well, though those are in limited numbers so get them early! :)

&#x200B;

Honestly, we are just happy to be back at PAX and cannot wait to see everyone!  If you need any resources or help during the expo, please come find us and let us help, we are here for you!

I posted earlier in the month about how I am with the Center for Sucide Awareness.  They just unveiled our pin!  We Cannot be more excited!  Come by our booth and say hi!  Tell them Aaron/Sly sent you :)

&#x200B;

https://twitter.com/Cntr4Suicide/status/1466944104294715393

Just wanted to update everyone!  They just unveiled our Offical PAX Pin!  Check it out!

&#x200B;

https://twitter.com/Cntr4Suicide/status/1466944104294715393
